# sidebar-scroll-click (fix-viewer-size phase 2): the x³ cell clicked at its
# scrolled place, so the click follows the scroll. The wheel of 40 puts the
# cell at (216, 122) 87 x 34 (the reference's own DOM), clear of the top
# bar's bottom edge at y 80, and the click lands on it: `func=x3` in the
# url. (The plan's 300 would put the cell at y -47, off the window, where no
# click can reach it — measured on ref-h11; the cell's own place is under
# the top bar's box at a 100 wheel, where the top bar takes the click.)
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 216 400
wheel 0 40
wait 1000
click 259.5 139
wait 1500
shot sidebar-scroll-click
